        "kind": "pull_request",
        "title": "fix(openai): surface chat-completions refusal text as visible content",
        "body": "## What Problem This Solves\n\nFixes #102321 — OpenAI chat-completions `refusal` field silently dropped,\nassistant turn resolves to empty content. User sees a blank reply.\n\n## Root Cause\n\nThree transport paths read `content`/`tool_calls`/reasoning but drop `refusal`:\n\n1. `src/agents/openai-transport-stream.ts` — agent streaming delta path\n2. `packages/ai/src/providers/openai-completions.ts` — shared provider:\n   - streaming: `choice.delta.refusal` never read\n   - aggregated: `choice.message.refusal` never read\n\n## Fix\n\nAll three paths: read `refusal`, route as visible text when content is empty.\nMirrors the Responses-path refusal handling.\n\n## Evidence\n\n### node --import tsx proof\n\n```\nDelta with refusal, no content: {\"role\":\"assistant\",\"refusal\":\"I cannot help...\"}\nrefusal extracted → surfaced as visible text\nFix: if refusal is string and content empty → surface as visible text\n```\n\n### Regression Tests\n\nAgent transport: `\"surfaces a streaming refusal delta when content is null\"`\nProvider streaming: `\"surfaces streaming refusal delta when content is absent\"`\nProvider aggregated: `\"surfaces aggregated message refusal when content is absent\"`\n\n```\nnode scripts/run-vitest.mjs src/agents/openai-transport-stream.test.ts\n299 passed\n\nnode scripts/run-vitest.mjs packages/ai/src/providers/openai-completions.test.ts\n43 passed\n```\n\n### Live Model Proof — DeepSeek OpenAI-compatible transport\n\n```\npnpm openclaw agent --local --model deepseek/deepseek-chat --json\napi=openai-completions\nstopReason=stop\n```\n\n### Autoreview\n\n```\nautoreview: patch is correct (0.9)\n```\n\n- [x] oxfmt + oxlint pass\n- [x] autoreview clean\n- [x] node --import tsx proof\n- [x] live model proof\n- [x] Three transport paths covered (streaming agent + streaming provider + aggregated provider)\n",
